### The Wilderness Bound update had lots of small technical changes which added up - so please report any Bugs you catch on our Discord server. 
### We also moved away from crowdin for our translations and now have our own solution. Feel free to contribute: https://explorerseden.eu/translate/
### Thank you!

# Changes
## Mods:
- Geophilic is not updated to 26.3 yet and therefore removed for the moment
- Added [Too Cheap!](https://modrinth.com/mod/too-cheap) Mod which removes the Anvil "Too Expensive" Cap
- Added [FallingTree](https://modrinth.com/mod/fallingtree) Mod:
    - Tress cut with a Netherite Axe while sneaking will fall on the floor with an animation
    - Trees cut this way will take up twice the durability per block affected
    - If the used Netherite Axe would break it will instead break most blocks and leave 1 durability point. If used again with 1 durability point, it breaks.

## Outer Wilds:
- Instead of repeating the Outer Wilds Actionbar notification, it is now only shown once when entering
- Added a new overlay Icon which shows up in the upper left corner while in the Outer Wilds (Thank you Arbor)

## Villages:
- Village names shown as titles now also have an animated letterbox effect
- Village names and colors are now based on the biome instead of the villager type
- Extended database for random Village names massively

## Structures:
- Replaced Powder Snow Blocks with Snow Blocks in Frostborne Shelter Structures
- Added Creeper Ruins Structure (Generates in Forest Biomes)

## Items:
- Added Kaleidoscope (can be crafted from 2 Iron Ingots and an Emerald)
- Added Straw Beds to list of non-droppable items
- Changed recipes for Rapiers to not conflict with left hand right compatibility

## Blocks:
- Crying Obsidian and Reinforced Deepslate can now be used as Nether Portal Frames
- Chopper blocks can now shear Pumpkins into Carved Pumpkins and Wool Blocks into Wool Stairs
- Redstone Wire, Redstone Torch, Repeater & Comparator Blocks are no longer washed away by fluids
- Red-/Brown Mushrooms are now placeable on Grass, Dirt, Mud, Moss, Farmland Blocks regardless of the light level

## Enchantments:
- Using Crop Dance succesfully now lets it rain the respective Crop (only visual)
- Night Vision now adds the typical night vision goggles effect instead of using Minecrafts effect
- Added Curse of Shortsight (Blurs vision when equipped)
- Added Curse of Color Blindness (Wearer becomes color blind when equipped)
- Added Curse of Mirror Vision (Wearers vision is mirrored horizontally when equipped)
- Added Curse of Void Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of the Void when equipped)
- Added Curse of Spider Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of a Spider when equipped)
- Added Curse of Creeper Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of a Creeper when equipped)
- Added Curse of Ender Vision (Wearer sees the world with the eyes of an Enderman when equipped)

## Mob Variants:
- Muddy Pig Variants can now also spawn in Dappled Forest Biomes
- Turkey Chicken Variant can now also spawn in Dappled Forrest Biomes
- Golden Chicken Variant can now also spawn in Abandoned Camp Structures
- Added Creeper Frog Variant (Frogs blown up by Creepers have a 33% chance to turn into this variant; can also spawn in Creeper Ruins Structures; Poops out Gunpowder when eating food entities)
- Creeper Cat Variant can now also spawn in Creeper Ruins Structures
- Added Zombified Pig Variant (Pigs have a 10% chance to turn into the Zombified Variant when 30 seconds or longer in the Nether)

## Advancements:
- Added 16 new progression advancements for Enchantments Encore
- Added 22 progression advancements for Fabled Roots
- Added 20 progression advancements for Nice Actions
- Added 6 progression advancements for Nice Keep Inventory
- Added 11 progression advancements for Nice Mob Manager
- Added 18 progression advancements for Nice Mob Manager
- Added 7 progression advancements for Nice Name Tags
- Added 17 progression advancements for Nice Things

## Misc:
- Updated Safe/Unsafe to TP tag lists for Waypoints
- Descendants now have a *swing* animation when giving out items after bartering
- Wandering Trader trades are now data driven and were added to the pool of vanilla uncommon ones

# Fixes
- Skeleton Pig variant having the wrong biome references for spawning